noise-c
=======

Upstream:  https://github.com/rweather/noise-c
Author:    Rhys Weatherley / Southern Storm Software, Pty Ltd.

librats implements the Noise Protocol Framework (Noise_XX_25519_ChaChaPoly_SHA256)
based on noise-c. The following librats sources are derived from noise-c and
carry the Southern Storm Software copyright notice:

    src/crypto/chacha.c           src/crypto/chacha.h
    src/crypto/sha256.c           src/crypto/sha256.h
    src/crypto/sha512.c           src/crypto/sha512.h
    src/crypto/blake2b.c          src/crypto/blake2b.h
    src/crypto/blake2s.c          src/crypto/blake2s.h
    src/crypto/blake2_endian.h

The BLAKE2b/BLAKE2s sources note that they in turn start from the versions in
arduinolibs (https://github.com/rweather/arduinolibs), by the same author and
under the same license.

